  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "\"Static Peck\" earned his moniker from a tragic accident at the old Subchain City power plant involving a wad of bubblegum and a live wire. Now, he haunts the ruins of Dia De Los Drinks, a bar he barely remembers running before the great DRIP drought, forever stuck between worlds.",
    "class": "Gloomhacker",
    "name": "Static Peck",
    "personality": "Jaded and nostalgic, Static Peck constantly reminisces about the good old days while simultaneously lamenting his grim situation. He spends most of his time blowing spectral bubbles only he can see, lost in the memories of past raids and cheap DRIP cocktails. Despite his gloomy outlook, Static Peck possesses a dry wit and an unexpected fondness for vintage video games.",
